"description":"Introducing “Music AI - Song Generator App”. \n\nSelect a song genre, add lyrics and our artificial intelligence will create a musical masterpiece for you!\nListen to the song right away, save it for later, or share the created composition with friends via social media.\n\nWhat can Music AI - Song Generator App offer?\n\nADVANCED ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE\nMusic AI's advanced algorithms analyze vast musical databases, identify patterns, and generate unique, high-quality melodies tailored to your preferences. Explore various genres, instruments, and styles, and watch as your musical vision comes to life.\n\nCHOOSE STYLE OR CREATE YOUR OWN\nTailor your music to match your desired style. Whether you're into classical symphonies, energetic electronic beats, infectious pop hooks, or soulful jazz melodies or just create your own style.\n\nEXPLORE COMMUNITY SONGS\nExplore thousands of song created by our community.\n\nSHARE WITH YOUR FRIENDS\nShare your favourite songs with your friends using magic link.\n\nEmbrace the future of music creation with Music AI. Download now and dive into musical journey where artificial intelligence meets your creative genius. Unleash your inner composer and witness the magic of AI-driven music generation today!\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://meteoraiapps.com/privacy-policy.html\n\nTerms of Use: https://meteoraiapps.com/terms-of-use.html", "trackId":6499523693, "trackName":"Music AI - Song Generator App", "userRatingCount":687}, 
