"description":"Turn any idea into a real, full song — in seconds. Describe what you want to hear, pick a genre, and AI Music writes the lyrics, sings the vocals, produces the track, and even designs the cover art. No instruments, no studio, no experience needed.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n1. Describe your song — a feeling, a story, a person, a moment. As simple or detailed as you like.\n2. Pick your style — Pop, Rap, Rock, R&B, Electronic, Jazz, Country, Latina, Reggae, Techno, House, Metal and many more.\n3. Get your song — complete with vocals, lyrics, and unique cover art. Ready to play, save, and share.\n\nTWO WAYS TO CREATE\n• Simple mode: one short prompt is all it takes. Need a spark? Tap an inspiration idea and go.\n• Custom mode: bring your own lyrics, name your song, and set the exact style you want. Your words, your music.\n\nWHY YOU'LL LOVE IT\n• Full songs, not loops — verses, chorus, real vocals or instrumental\n• 20+ genres to explore, from Hip-Hop to Gospel to Dubstep\n• Time-synced lyrics — follow every word karaoke-style as your song plays\n• Unique AI cover art generated for every track\n• Your personal library — play, manage, and revisit all your creations\n• Share anywhere — send your songs to friends or post them on social media\n• Get notified the moment your song is ready\n• Keep listening in the background, on AirPlay, or in your car\n\nPERFECT FOR\n• Birthday and anniversary surprises that beat any greeting card\n• Songs for your partner, your kids, your best friend — or your pet\n• Content for TikTok, Reels, and YouTube\n• Party anthems, road-trip soundtracks, study beats\n• Songwriters sketching ideas in seconds instead of hours\n\nWhether you're a total beginner or a musician hunting for inspiration, AI Music turns what's in your head into music you can actually hear — and share with the world.\n\nDownload AI Music now and create your first song today.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.funky-monkey-apps.com/privacy-policy\nTerms of Use: https://www.funky-monkey-apps.com/term-of-us", "trackId":6448696426, "trackName":"AI Music & Song Generator *", "userRatingCount":1270}, 
