"description":"Melodia - Al Music Maker\n\nMelodia's next-gen AI song maker lets you write original tracks, craft viral covers, or transform your vocals, no studio, skills, or instruments required.\nChoose from a wide range of styles and genres, including pop, rap, blues, funk, classical, EDM, R&B, lo-fi, rock, trap, acoustic, orchestral, and more.\nWhatever your vibe, Melodia helps bring your musical vision to life with just a few taps.\n\nKey Features:\nAl Song Maker\nDescribe your idea, pick a genre and vocal style, and create an original song or cover from scratch with Melodia.\n\nAl Cover Generator\nPaste a song link, choose a voice, and recreate your favorite tracks with different vocals or genres to give any classic a fresh vibe.\n\nVoice-to-Song Studio\nUpload your vocals or recordings to train the AI, and customize pitch and tempo for fully personalized results.\n\nRealistic, Natural-Sounding Vocals\nGenerate tracks with human-like vocals that add depth to your music.\n\nMulti-Genre Support\nMix and match genres-pop, rap, rock, electronic, and more-to fit your creative vision.\n\nMood & Prompt Controls\nSelect moods like Happy, Confident, or Motivational, or type a custom prompt for lightning-fast results.\n\nMelodia makes producing songs and covers easy. Every track you create is royalty-free and can be shared anywhere. Whether you're experimenting or polishing a final mix, the app gives you the tools to make music your way.\n\nPerfect For:\n﻿﻿Musicians prototyping hooks faster than ever\n﻿﻿Creators who need copyright-safe background music\n﻿﻿Singers looking for professional vocal effects\n﻿﻿Anyone who wants to have fun making songs with Al\nNote: Melodia Al doesn't supply songs or voices-you provide the source material. Use Melodia for entertainment and respect copyright rules when sharing. Some features require a Melodia Pro subscription.\nDownload Melodia - Al Song Maker today and start creating professional-quality music with Al.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://appnation.co/privacy\nTerms of Service: https://appnation.co/terms", "trackId":1669070669, "trackName":"AI Music Maker - Melodia", "userRatingCount":1088}]
